**/dist
.npmrc

## Relayer configuration files — these hold secrets (signer key, RPC URLs with embedded
## API keys) and must never be tracked. Commit the *.example.json templates instead.
config.json
config.sepolia.json

## Operational state, not source. `config.sepolia.example.json` points
## sqlite_db_path at ./data/relayer.sqlite, so the directory is kept (via .gitkeep)
## but its contents never are: the DB accumulates relay history, churns on every
## run, and has no business in the index.
data/*.sqlite
data/*.sqlite-journal
data/*.sqlite-wal
data/*.sqlite-shm
